      "source": [
        "# Notes for Future Changes\n",
        "\n",
        "- To change the GL codes modeled, edit `TARGET_GL_CODES` in the Modeling Functions section.\n",
        "- To change the forecast horizon, edit `FORECAST_HORIZON`.\n",
        "- To use a longer validation period, edit `HOLDOUT_SIZE`.\n",
        "- The ARIMA/SARIMA section uses annual data, so no explicit seasonal period is included. If monthly data are modeled later, add a seasonal order with a 12-month period.\n",
        "- GL `3290` is excluded from `minor_df` because it is treated as Major.\n"
      ],
